msgctxt "#32669"
msgid "How high the glass panels seem to float: their shadow grows and drops. Mild: close to the page. Medium: as before. Strong: higher. Heavy: highest."
msgstr "Hvor højt glaspanelerne ser ud til at svæve: deres skygge vokser og falder. Mild: tæt på siden. Medium: som før. Stærk: højere. Kraftig: højest."

msgctxt "#32670"
msgid "Mild"
msgstr "Mild"

msgctxt "#32671"
msgid "Heavy"
msgstr "Tung"

msgctxt "#32672"
msgid "Expert settings"
msgstr "Ekspertindstillinger"

msgctxt "#32673"
msgid "Shows the rows below for fine-tuning the glass panels and the fanart behind the library views."
msgstr "Viser rækkerne nedenfor til finjustering af glaspanelerne og fanart bag biblioteksvisningerne."

msgctxt "#32674"
msgid "Panel opacity"
msgstr "Paneluigennemsigtighed"

msgctxt "#32675"
msgid "How solid the glass panels are, around the Skin style's own value. -2: most see-through. +2: most solid."
msgstr "Hvor massive glaspanelerne er, omkring skin-stilens egen værdi. -2: mest gennemsigtig. +2: mest massiv."

msgctxt "#32676"
msgid "Panel blur"
msgstr "Panelsløring"

msgctxt "#32677"
msgid "How strongly the panels blur the picture behind them. Off: no blur."
msgstr "Hvor kraftigt panelerne slører billedet bag dem. Fra: ingen sløring."

msgctxt "#32678"
msgid "Panel tint"
msgstr "Paneltone"

msgctxt "#32679"
msgid "The colour of the panels' glass, around the Skin style's own. -2: darkest. +2: lightest frost."
msgstr "Farven på panelernes glas, omkring skin-stilens egen. -2: mørkest. +2: lyseste frost."

msgctxt "#32680"
msgid "Library fanart opacity"
msgstr "Bibliotekets fanart-dækkevne"

msgctxt "#32681"
msgid "How much of the fanart behind the library views shows, on top of Backdrop strength. -2: faintest. +2: strongest."
msgstr "Hvor meget af fanart bag biblioteksvisningerne der ses, oven i baggrundsstyrken. -2: svagest. +2: stærkest."

msgctxt "#32682"
msgid "Library fanart blur"
msgstr "Bibliotekets fanart-sløring"

msgctxt "#32683"
msgid "Blurs the fanart behind the library views: -2 a little, +2 the most; 0 is the default. Off: sharp."
msgstr "Slører fanart bag biblioteksvisningerne: -2 lidt, +2 mest; 0 er standard. Fra: skarp."

msgctxt "#32684"
msgid "Library fanart tint"
msgstr "Bibliotekets fanart-toning"

msgctxt "#32685"
msgid "The colour tint of the Frosted fanart look. Off: no tint."
msgstr "Farvetonen i fanart-udseendet Frost. Fra: ingen tone."

msgctxt "#32686"
msgid "Reset expert settings"
msgstr "Nulstil ekspertindstillinger"

msgctxt "#32687"
msgid "Puts every expert setting back to its default."
msgstr "Sætter alle ekspertindstillinger tilbage til standard."

msgctxt "#32688"
msgid "Expert settings are back to their defaults."
msgstr "Ekspertindstillingerne er tilbage på standard."

msgctxt "#32689"
msgid "Menu background"
msgstr "Menubaggrund"

msgctxt "#32690"
msgid "Screen"
msgstr "Skærm"

msgctxt "#32691"
msgid "Menus and dialogs in the Fused Glass style. Fanart: the item's fanart behind them. Screen: the screen they opened on, dimmed."
msgstr "Menuer og dialoger i Fused Glass-stilen. Fanart: elementets fanart bag dem. Skærm: skærmen de blev åbnet på, dæmpet."

msgctxt "#32692"
msgid "OK runs it  ·  Back closes"
msgstr "OK kører  ·  Tilbage lukker"

msgctxt "#32693"
msgid "OK chooses  ·  Back closes"
msgstr "OK vælger  ·  Tilbage lukker"

msgctxt "#32694"
msgid "Its own library views and menus: rounded glass cards with soft shadows float over the artwork, in Dark, Clear, Frost or the Fused Glass style."
msgstr "Egne biblioteksvisninger og menuer: afrundede glaskort med bløde skygger svæver over billederne, i stilen Mørk, Klar, Frost eller Fused Glass."

msgctxt "#32695"
msgid "Use the defaults"
msgstr "Brug standarderne"

msgctxt "#32696"
msgid "The chosen theme as it comes, at once. Everything can be changed later in Skin settings."
msgstr "Det valgte tema, som det er, med det samme. Alt kan ændres senere i Skin-indstillinger."

msgctxt "#32697"
msgid "Customise"
msgstr "Tilpas"

msgctxt "#32698"
msgid "Go through the look, libraries, Home and backgrounds page by page. Every row shows a preview of its choice."
msgstr "Gå udseende, biblioteker, Hjem og baggrunde igennem side for side. Hver række viser en forhåndsvisning af valget."

msgctxt "#32699"
msgid "Keep my current settings"
msgstr "Behold mine nuværende indstillinger"

msgctxt "#32700"
msgid "Leave every setting as it is: only the theme you picked changes."
msgstr "Alle indstillinger forbliver som de er: kun det valgte tema ændres."

msgctxt "#32701"
msgid "Aeon with glass menus: the same layout and library views as Aeon, with see-through glass menus and dialogs instead of solid ones. No palettes."
msgstr "Aeon med glasmenuer: samme layout og biblioteksvisninger som Aeon, med gennemsigtige glasmenuer og dialoger i stedet for faste. Ingen paletter."

msgctxt "#32702"
msgid "The Planner of upcoming episodes and films, online rows and extra ratings."
msgstr "Planlæggeren med kommende afsnit og film, onlinerækker og ekstra bedømmelser."

msgctxt "#32703"
msgid "The Next up row: the next episode of every show you are watching."
msgstr "Rækken Næste: det næste afsnit af hver serie, du ser."

msgctxt "#32704"
msgid "Lyrics on the Now playing screen, line by line or word by word."
msgstr "Sangtekster på skærmen Afspilles nu, linje for linje eller ord for ord."

msgctxt "#32705"
msgid "Artist pictures behind the Now playing screen."
msgstr "Kunstnerbilleder bag skærmen Afspilles nu."

msgctxt "#32706"
msgid "Box colours taken from the artwork."
msgstr "Boksfarver taget fra billederne."

msgctxt "#32707"
msgid "Skip intro, recap and credits buttons in the player."
msgstr "Knapper til at springe intro, resumé og rulletekster over i afspilleren."

msgctxt "#32708"
msgid "Thumbnail previews on the seek bar."
msgstr "Miniaturevisninger på søgebjælken."

msgctxt "#32709"
msgid "Studio and network logos in the libraries and on the information page."
msgstr "Studie- og kanallogoer i bibliotekerne og på informationssiden."

msgctxt "#32710"
msgid "Record label logos for albums."
msgstr "Pladeselskabslogoer til albums."

msgctxt "#32711"
msgid "Language flags in the video information."
msgstr "Sprogflag i videoinformationen."

msgctxt "#32712"
msgid "The skin's own screensaver: library pictures with a slow zoom and slide, and what is playing."
msgstr "Skinnets egen pauseskærm: billeder fra biblioteket med langsom zoom og glidning, og det der afspilles."

msgctxt "#32713"
msgid "Aeon: solid panels in a palette you pick. Aeon Glass: the same Aeon layout and views with glass menus, no palettes. Fused Glass: its own library views, rounded glass cards over the artwork."
msgstr "Aeon: faste paneler i en palet, du vælger. Aeon Glass: samme Aeon-layout og visninger med glasmenuer, uden paletter. Fused Glass: egne biblioteksvisninger, afrundede glaskort over billederne."

msgctxt "#32714"
msgid "Its own views, glass cards"
msgstr "Egne visninger, glaskort"

msgctxt "#32715"
msgid "Take the theme as it comes, or go through its look step by step. Everything can be changed later in Skin settings."
msgstr "Tag temaet, som det er, eller gå dets udseende igennem trin for trin. Alt kan ændres senere i Skin-indstillinger."

msgctxt "#32716"
msgid "How the settings strip of the library views shows: over the view (Overlay) or always beside it (Permanent)."
msgstr "Hvordan indstillingsbjælken i biblioteksvisningerne vises: over visningen (Overlejring) eller altid ved siden af (Permanent)."

msgctxt "#32717"
msgid "How much the edges of the Home screen darken behind the menu and the text."
msgstr "Hvor meget kanterne af Hjem-skærmen mørknes bag menuen og teksten."

msgctxt "#32718"
msgid "The colour of the clock box and the corner boxes with the Aeon palette."
msgstr "Farven på urboksen og hjørneboksene med Aeon-paletten."

msgctxt "#32719"
msgid "Optional add-ons that give the skin more to show. Install the ones you want; the rest can wait."
msgstr "Valgfrie tilføjelser, der giver skinnet mere at vise. Installer dem, du vil have; resten kan vente."

msgctxt "#32720"
msgid "The disc art spinning beside the poster on the player controls: for videos, for music, for both, or off."
msgstr "Den roterende diskgrafik ved plakaten på afspillerknapperne: til videoer, til musik, til begge eller fra."

msgctxt "#32721"
msgid "What the text under a title shows in every library view: the plot, the tagline (when there is one) or both."
msgstr "Hvad teksten under en titel viser i alle biblioteksvisninger: handlingen, taglinen (når der er en) eller begge."

msgctxt "#32722"
msgid "Libraries"
msgstr "Biblioteker"

msgctxt "#32723"
msgid "Information"
msgstr "Information"

msgctxt "#32724"
msgid "Screensaver & backdrops"
msgstr "Pauseskærm og baggrunde"

msgctxt "#32725"
msgid "Export skin settings"
msgstr "Eksportér skinindstillinger"

msgctxt "#32726"
msgid "Import skin settings"
msgstr "Importér skinindstillinger"

msgctxt "#32727"
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Gem"

msgctxt "#32728"
msgid "Load"
msgstr "Indlæs"

msgctxt "#32729"
msgid "Saves every Aeon Fuse setting, with the theme, palette and fonts, to a file in a folder you pick."
msgstr "Gemmer alle Aeon Fuse-indstillinger med tema, palet og skrifttyper i en fil i en mappe, du vælger."

msgctxt "#32730"
msgid "Loads a file saved with Export skin settings. Your current skin settings are replaced."
msgstr "Indlæser en fil gemt med Eksportér skinindstillinger. Dine nuværende skinindstillinger erstattes."

msgctxt "#32731"
msgid "Folder for the settings file"
msgstr "Mappe til indstillingsfilen"

msgctxt "#32732"
msgid "Settings file to load"
msgstr "Indstillingsfil der skal indlæses"

msgctxt "#32733"
msgid "Saved: %s"
msgstr "Gemt: %s"

msgctxt "#32734"
msgid "Load the settings saved on %s? Your current skin settings are replaced."
msgstr "Indlæs indstillingerne gemt %s? Dine nuværende skinindstillinger erstattes."

msgctxt "#32735"
msgid "This file does not hold Aeon Fuse settings."
msgstr "Denne fil indeholder ikke Aeon Fuse-indstillinger."

msgctxt "#32736"
msgid "The file could not be written."
msgstr "Filen kunne ikke skrives."

msgctxt "#32737"
msgid "Kodi restarts to apply them."
msgstr "Kodi genstarter for at anvende dem."

msgctxt "#32738"
msgid "The skin reloads; restart Kodi afterwards so every setting is read again."
msgstr "Skinnet genindlæses; genstart Kodi bagefter, så alle indstillinger læses igen."

msgctxt "#32739"
msgid "These settings are already in use."
msgstr "Disse indstillinger er allerede i brug."

msgctxt "#32740"
msgid "Soft"
msgstr "Blød"

msgctxt "#32741"
msgid "Home gradient"
msgstr "Gradient på Hjem"

msgctxt "#32742"
msgid "Beside the clock"
msgstr "Ved siden af uret"

msgctxt "#32743"
msgid "Left corner"
msgstr "Venstre hjørne"

msgctxt "#32744"
msgid "The fade from the bottom of the screen up to the Home menu: off, soft (the look so far) or strong."
msgstr "Overgangen fra bunden af skærmen op til hovedmenuen: fra, blød (det hidtidige udseende) eller stærk."

msgctxt "#32745"
msgid "Where the Now playing capsule sits on Home while music plays: beside the clock or in the lower left corner."
msgstr "Hvor Afspilles nu-kapslen sidder på Hjem, mens der spilles musik: ved siden af uret eller i nederste venstre hjørne."

msgctxt "#32746"
msgid "How the skip button sits on the player controls: a white tab on their top edge, or a glass capsule above them."
msgstr "Hvordan spring over-knappen sidder på afspillerens knapper: en hvid fane på deres øverste kant eller en glaskapsel over dem."

msgctxt "#32747"
msgid "How strongly the picture behind the menus and dialogs is blurred. Off: sharp, as before."
msgstr "Hvor kraftigt billedet bag menuer og dialoger sløres. Fra: skarpt, som hidtil."

msgctxt "#32748"
msgid "Left / Right: choose an option. OK: set it. Up, Down or Back: keep the one in use."
msgstr "Venstre / Højre: vælg en mulighed. OK: indstil den. Op, Ned eller Tilbage: behold den nuværende."

msgctxt "#32749"
msgid "Start on"
msgstr "Start på"

msgctxt "#32750"
msgid "The Home menu item that has the focus when Kodi starts, once the splash has gone."
msgstr "Det punkt i hjemmemenuen, der har fokus, når Kodi starter, når startskærmen er væk."

msgctxt "#32751"
msgid "Ratings shown in"
msgstr "Bedømmelser vises i"

msgctxt "#32752"
msgid "Media info shown in"
msgstr "Medieinfo vises i"

msgctxt "#32753"
msgid "Library views"
msgstr "Biblioteksvisninger"

msgctxt "#32754"
msgid "Information pages"
msgstr "Informationssider"

msgctxt "#32755"
msgid "Widget & Spotlight screens"
msgstr "Widget- og Spotlight-skærme"

msgctxt "#32756"
msgid "Home spotlights"
msgstr "Spotlights på startskærmen"

msgctxt "#32757"
msgid "Player info"
msgstr "Afspillerinfo"

msgctxt "#32758"
msgid "Screensaver"
msgstr "Pauseskærm"

msgctxt "#32759"
msgid "Live TV"
msgstr "Live-tv"

msgctxt "#32760"
msgid "Where the ratings (IMDb, TMDb, Rotten Tomatoes, Trakt) appear. OK opens the list: tick the places."
msgstr "Hvor bedømmelserne (IMDb, TMDb, Rotten Tomatoes, Trakt) vises. OK åbner listen: sæt flueben ved stederne."

msgctxt "#32761"
msgid "Where the media info chips (resolution, HDR, audio ...) appear. OK opens the list: tick the places. Which chips: Media info chips."
msgstr "Hvor medieinfo-mærkerne (opløsning, HDR, lyd ...) vises. OK åbner listen: sæt flueben ved stederne. Hvilke mærker: Medieinfo-mærker."

msgctxt "#32762"
msgid "Recommended add-ons"
msgstr "Anbefalede tilføjelser"

msgctxt "#32764"
msgid "Installed"
msgstr "Installeret"

msgctxt "#32765"
msgid "Not installed"
msgstr "Ikke installeret"

msgctxt "#32766"
msgid "%s needs the %s repository. Install that repository first?"
msgstr "%s kræver %s-kilden. Installer den kilde først?"

msgctxt "#32767"
msgid "White weather icons for the weather forecast."
msgstr "Hvide vejrikoner til vejrudsigten."

msgctxt "#32768"
msgid "The playback info button in the video controls."
msgstr "Knappen med afspilningsinfo i videokontrollerne."

msgctxt "#32769"
msgid "The Inter (Copacetic) font set."
msgstr "Skrifttypesættet Inter (Copacetic)."

msgctxt "#32770"
msgid "The Roboto CJKSC font set for Chinese, Japanese and Korean."
msgstr "Skrifttypesættet Roboto CJKSC til kinesisk, japansk og koreansk."

msgctxt "#32771"
msgid "Update and clean on another Kodi"
msgstr "Opdater og ryd op på en anden Kodi"

msgctxt "#32772"
msgid "Address"
msgstr "Adresse"

msgctxt "#32773"
msgid "User name"
msgstr "Brugernavn"

msgctxt "#32774"
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Adgangskode"

msgctxt "#32775"
msgid "Test connection"
msgstr "Test forbindelsen"

msgctxt "#32776"
msgid "Library update and clean from this skin (Home, the library panel, the context menu) go to another Kodi, a headless one for instance, instead of this one."
msgstr "Opdatering og oprydning af biblioteket fra dette skin (startskærm, bibliotekspanel, genvejsmenu) sendes til en anden Kodi, fx en uden skærm, i stedet for denne."

msgctxt "#32777"
msgid "The other Kodi's web address and port, for example http://192.168.10.10:8080 (there: Settings > Services > Control > Allow remote control via HTTP)."
msgstr "Den anden Kodis webadresse og port, fx http://192.168.10.10:8080 (dér: Indstillinger > Tjenester > Styring > Tillad fjernstyring via HTTP)."

msgctxt "#32778"
msgid "The web server user name and password of the other Kodi."
msgstr "Webserverens brugernavn og adgangskode på den anden Kodi."

msgctxt "#32779"
msgid "Asks the other Kodi for its version: checks the address, user name and password."
msgstr "Spørger den anden Kodi om dens version: tjekker adresse, brugernavn og adgangskode."

msgctxt "#32780"
msgid "Not set"
msgstr "Ikke angivet"

msgctxt "#32781"
msgid "Library update sent"
msgstr "Biblioteksopdatering sendt"

msgctxt "#32782"
msgid "Library clean sent"
msgstr "Biblioteksoprydning sendt"

msgctxt "#32783"
msgid "Could not reach %s: %s"
msgstr "Kunne ikke nå %s: %s"

msgctxt "#32784"
msgid "%s answers: %s"
msgstr "%s svarer: %s"

msgctxt "#32785"
msgid "Wrong user name or password"
msgstr "Forkert brugernavn eller adgangskode"

msgctxt "#32786"
msgid "Library update finished"
msgstr "Biblioteksopdatering færdig"

msgctxt "#32789"
msgid "Failed"
msgstr "Mislykkedes"

msgctxt "#32790"
msgid "Could not install the repository"
msgstr "Kunne ikke installere kilden"

msgctxt "#32791"
msgid "Pick the add-ons you want: OK ticks one, Next installs the ticked ones while you go on. The picture shows what each adds. Later: Skin settings > System > Recommended add-ons."
msgstr "Vælg de tilføjelser, du vil have: OK sætter flueben, Næste installerer de afkrydsede, mens du fortsætter. Billedet viser, hvad hver tilføjer. Senere: Skin-indstillinger > System > Anbefalede tilføjelser."

msgctxt "#32792"
msgid "Will be installed"
msgstr "Bliver installeret"

msgctxt "#32793"
msgid "Installs the ticked add-ons"
msgstr "Installerer de afkrydsede tilføjelser"

msgctxt "#32794"
msgid "Installed: %s"
msgstr "Installeret: %s"

msgctxt "#32795"
msgid "Delete %s? Its name, path, icon, widgets and submenu are removed; the items below it move up one place."
msgstr "Slet %s? Navn, sti, ikon, widgets og undermenu fjernes; punkterne under det rykker én plads op."

msgctxt "#32796"
msgid "Custom items only"
msgstr "Kun egne punkter"

msgctxt "#32797"
msgid "A calm, thin waveform on the Now playing card, drawn in the skin's own box and smoothed so loud passages do not spike. The build for this device is installed."
msgstr "En rolig, tynd bølgeform på kortet Afspiller nu, tegnet i skinnets egen boks og udglattet, så høje passager ikke giver spidser. Versionen til denne enhed installeres."

msgctxt "#32798"
msgid "More by the artist"
msgstr "Mere fra kunstneren"

msgctxt "#32799"
msgid "Intermission at"
msgstr "Pause kl."

msgctxt "#32800"
msgid "Your languages"
msgstr "Dine sprog"

msgctxt "#32801"
msgid "All others"
msgstr "Alle andre"

msgctxt "#32802"
msgid "In your library"
msgstr "I dit bibliotek"

msgctxt "#32803"
msgid "Sort and show"
msgstr "Sortér og vis"

msgctxt "#32804"
msgid "Sort by"
msgstr "Sortér efter"

msgctxt "#32805"
msgid "Show only"
msgstr "Vis kun"

msgctxt "#32806"
msgid "OK again flips the order"
msgstr "OK igen vender rækkefølgen"

msgctxt "#32807"
msgid "Several versions"
msgstr "Flere versioner"

msgctxt "#32808"
msgid "Decade"
msgstr "Årti"

msgctxt "#32809"
msgid "Clear all"
msgstr "Ryd alle"

msgctxt "#32810"
msgid "Never played"
msgstr "Aldrig afspillet"

msgctxt "#32811"
msgid "Played"
msgstr "Afspillet"

msgctxt "#32812"
msgid "timers in the next five days"
msgstr "timere de næste fem dage"

msgctxt "#32813"
msgid "Next in {0}"
msgstr "Næste om {0}"

msgctxt "#32814"
msgid "{0} set to record"
msgstr "{0} sat til optagelse"

msgctxt "#32815"
msgid "Nothing set – pick a programme in the guide"
msgstr "Intet sat – vælg et program i guiden"

msgctxt "#32816"
msgid "No timers set"
msgstr "Ingen timere sat"

msgctxt "#32817"
msgid "Rules set timers for you"
msgstr "Regler sætter timere for dig"

msgctxt "#32818"
msgid "No timer rules – set one from a programme in the guide"
msgstr "Ingen regler – opret en fra et program i guiden"

